                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Early days for this game but you can already see the potential. The developers seem to know the 90's era well and have nailed the art style and gameplay. \n\nThere’s only one level at the moment and there’s a lack of polish, but it’s definitely fun enough to play more than a few times and feels like a healthy mix of RayCrisis and U. N. Squadron.\n\nConsidering the price and the fact that two guys are building this from scratch, I would definitely consider supporting them. They seem to be community driven and really passionate about the game",
